#### 证据与依据

**依据 1 · 源码核查**：[lib/index.js:131-220](https://github.com/7gzgn/dsh-restart-dock/blob/bb74ab5d5eafdd97cec75a0be759346fdcacece7/lib/index.js#L131-L220)

